WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose London and Paris, then search for a flight.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.750
Flight results appear. Select a flight.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:15.000
Enter fictional passenger and contact details.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.250
Confirm the booking and see its reference.

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:24.000
Enter a test card and pay.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.020
The demo displays a payment success message.
